      "content": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi friends!<br />\nVelle by MisterPink came out ~3 days ago and I've never liked a base model so much. She's super cute and I can't wait for more assets to come out. That being said, I wanted to start a megathread for her assets that have been found/bought so we can keep track of the various cute things that drop following her release! I will try to contribute where I can. Feel free to add any links to the comments where you have found new booth links or their respective downloads. Thanks everyone in advance, and sorry my formatting is kind of shitty, LOL</p>\n<h2><strong>Base Model ( found by <a class=\"plugin-mentions-user plugin-mentions-a\" href=\"/user/misu\">@<bdi>Misu</bdi></a> )</strong></h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Booth Link: <a href=\"https://booth.pm/en/items/4951792\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://booth.pm/en/items/4951792</a><br />\nDL V1.1: <a href=\"https://forum.ripper.store/topic/9780/mister-pink-velle\">https://forum.ripper.store/topic/9780/mister-pink-velle</a><br />\n<img src=\"/assets/uploads/files/1692057924446-72993f89-780a-4236-ad54-5cbd44c94d6c-image.png\" alt=\"72993f89-780a-4236-ad54-5cbd44c94d6c-image.png\" class=\" img-fluid img-markdown\" /></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><strong>Outfits</strong></h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">(in no particular order, i'll try and sort them later)</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>BECKENZI Cropped Hoodie, Pants, Accessories / BECKENZI パーカー、パンツ、ブーツ + アクセサリー ( Thank you <a class=\"plugin-mentions-user plugin-mentions-a\" href=\"/user/myemika\">@<bdi>MyeMika</bdi></a> ! )</strong><br />\nBooth Link: <a href=\"https://booth.pm/en/items/4996774\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://booth.pm/en/items/4996774</a><br />\nDL: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wMdTjOqjuerTdFv1EU09QHHQPWZApHB4/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wMdTjOqjuerTdFv1EU09QHHQPWZApHB4/view?usp=sharing</a><br />\n<img src=\"/assets/uploads/files/1692057975086-7f73d51