    {
      "content": "<p dir=\"auto\">I forgot that I bought the rabbit costume a few hours ago.<br>\nThe bad thing is that this creator doesn't know how to give the correct weight to the clothes and clips a lot on butt and with oppai+</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"card col-md-9 col-lg-6 position-relative link-preview p-0\">\n\n\n\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EGLy2jjMy7vVFgXN0DXeyGsv0F0A_HBz\" title=\"Bunny – Google&nbsp;Drive\">\n<img src=\"https://ssl.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/drive_2020q4_48dp.png\" class=\"card-img-top not-responsive\" style=\"max-height: 15rem;\" alt=\"Link Preview Image\">\n</a>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<h5 class=\"card-title\">\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EGLy2jjMy7vVFgXN0DXeyGsv0F0A_HBz\">\nBunny – Google&nbsp;Drive\n</a>\n</h5>\n<p class=\"card-text line-clamp-3\"></p>\n</div>\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EGLy2jjMy7vVFgXN0DXeyGsv0F0A_HBz\" class=\"card-footer text-body-secondary small d-flex gap-2 align-items-center lh-2\">\n\n\n\n<img src=\"https://ssl.gstatic.com/docs/doclist/images/drive_2022q3_32dp.png\" alt=\"favicon\" class=\"not-responsive\" style=\"max-width: 21px; max-height: 21px;\">\n\n\n\n<p class=\"d-inline-block text-truncate mb-0\">Google Drive <span class=\"text-secondary\">(drive.google.com)</span></p>\n</a>\n</div></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">PS. I add to the folder my edited fbx to work with MA and with the missing bones.<br>\nJust replace the suit fbx in the project and transfer the bunny ears settings from the prefab.</p>\n",
